WEBVTT

00:01.240 --> 00:02.640
Have the requests for aid been sent?

00:02.720 --> 00:07.640
Already sent to General Zu Yue and General Chen Ying sent out over twenty.

00:07.720 --> 00:12.480
Light cavalry from the city should at least some messages will get through.

00:12.560 --> 00:17.840
Wutu cavalry are strong in field battles Zu Yue's army if they cannot repel Ayigu.

00:17.920 --> 00:24.320
Will find it very difficult to send troops to support us General Zu Kun connected Wuyang and Yiyang into a line precisely to.

00:24.440 --> 00:28.987
Deal with this situation so now we can only rely on Wuyang.

00:29.680 --> 00:31.080
Rely on Chen Ying.

